          "src/benchmark/benchmark_raw.cpp lines 10-43 (allocateDmaBuffer, declared in benchmark_internal.h) does the identical allocation and null-check but logs a labeled message plus DMA/INTERNAL capability and buffer address -- richer diagnostics for the same failure mode.",
