        ],
        "suggestion": "Extract one shared chunked-loop helper (e.g. runChunkedIo(FsFile&, buffer, totalSize, stageLabel, showLiveRate, perChunkFn) or a small lambda-driven loop) that the three call sites configure with the differing per-chunk operation, instead of maintaining three parallel copies of the same loop body.",
