          "test_app_types.cpp only checks that csdOk defaults to false -- no test or production code checks it becoming true."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Remove the unused CardInfo::csdOk field (app_types.h) and the corresponding `info.csdOk = true;` assignment in fillCardIdentity() (sd_card.cpp), since cidOk already reflects the same success condition and is the field actually consulted.",
