          "spi_scale_benchmark.cpp writes point.errorCode/point.errorData in three failure branches (lines 73-101), but display_results.cpp's uiShowSpiScaleResult()/buildScaleSummary() (and ui_geometry.cpp's scalePointCoords()/buildScaleSummary()) only ever read point.ok/point.rawReadMBs/point.efficiencyPercent \u2014 the captured codes for failed points are never displayed anywhere.",
